    When a partner order for account "No Such Account" with 1 Widget is posted # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:30
    Then the partner request answers 422                                       # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:55

  Scenario: Partner order for an unknown product is refused                  # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:15
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000                              # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When a partner order for the customer with 1 "No Such Product" is posted # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:35
    Then the partner request answers 422                                     # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:55

  Scenario: Partner order with no items is refused                # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:20
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000                   # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When a partner order for the customer with no items is posted # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:40
    Then the partner request answers 400                          # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:55

  Scenario: Partner order with a zero quantity is refused         # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:25
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000                   # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When a partner order for the customer with 0 Widget is posted # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:45
    Then the partner request answers 400                          # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:55

  Scenario: Partner order over the credit limit is refused                     # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:30
    Given a new customer with credit limit 100                                 # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When a partner order for the customer with 1 Widget and 2 Gadget is posted # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:24
    Then the partner request answers 400                                       # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:55
    And the partner error mentions "exceeds credit limit"                      # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:67
    And the customer balance is 0                                              # features/steps/check_credit.py:112

  Scenario: Partner order without a token is refused                              # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:37
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000                                   # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When a partner order for the customer with 1 Widget is posted without a token # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:50
    Then the partner request answers 401                                          # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:55

  Scenario: Inbound order message is persisted as an order                         # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:42
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000                                    # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When an inbound order message for the customer is delivered to topic order_b2b # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:125
    Then the inbound message is processed                                          # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:140
    And the customer balance is 390                                                # features/steps/check_credit.py:112

  Scenario: Inbound order message for an unknown account is rejected                     # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:48
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000                                          # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When an inbound order message for an unknown account is delivered to topic order_b2b # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:130
    Then the inbound message is rejected with "no Customer"                              # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:145

  Scenario: A rejected inbound order message stays on its blob with the reason (live Kafka only)  # features/order_b2b_intake.feature:53
    Given a new customer with credit limit 100                                                    # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When an inbound order message for the customer is delivered live to topic order_b2b           # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:135
    Then the inbound message blob is unprocessed and has error_text "exceeds credit limit"        # features/steps/order_b2b_intake.py:151

Feature: Order Shipping Notification # features/order_shipping_notification.feature:1

  Scenario: Shipping an order publishes a shipping message  # features/order_shipping_notification.feature:3
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000             # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    And an order is placed with 2 Widget                    # features/steps/check_credit.py:44
    When the order is shipped                               # features/steps/check_credit.py:60
    Then a shipping message is published for the order      # features/steps/order_shipping_notification.py:24

  Scenario: An unshipped order publishes nothing  # features/order_shipping_notification.feature:9
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000   # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When an order is placed with 2 Widget         # features/steps/check_credit.py:44
    Then no shipping message is published         # features/steps/order_shipping_notification.py:30

  Scenario: An order created already shipped publishes a shipping message  # features/order_shipping_notification.feature:14
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000                            # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    When an order is created already shipped                               # features/steps/order_shipping_notification.py:11
    Then a shipping message is published for the order                     # features/steps/order_shipping_notification.py:24

  Scenario: Changing a shipped order does not publish again  # features/order_shipping_notification.feature:19
    Given a new customer with credit limit 1000              # features/steps/check_credit.py:7
    And an order is placed with 2 Widget                     # features/steps/check_credit.py:44
    And the order is shipped                                 # features/steps/check_credit.py:60
    When the order notes are changed                         # features/steps/order_shipping_notification.py:18
    Then one shipping message was published                  # features/steps/order_shipping_notification.py:35

